## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** OpenCode Zen's "stealth" free reasoning model available October 6–9, 2026 (3 days only). 1M context window, multimodal (text+image), tool calls. **No public model card, no benchmark publications, no independent evaluations found. Vendor unidentified. Slot deprecated (HTTP 410 ModelDeprecated).**
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/exo-free`). Chat Completions API. **Now deprecated — endpoint returns HTTP 410.**
- **Release / knowledge:** ~2026-10-06 (OpenCode Zen changelog); knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free` (free tier on OpenCode Zen, now retired)
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens claimed (OpenCode Zen); max output 131,072 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out; image in (claimed); reasoning yes; tool calls yes; JSON mode yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-08):** **FREE** on OpenCode Zen during limited preview (rate-limited: ~20 req/min, 50/day typical); **now unavailable (HTTP 410)**.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed; proprietary (OpenCode Zen); parameter count unknown. Vendor never identified.

